<reference id="resolved_issues_hdm">
    <title>Resolved Issues in Home Device Manager</title>
    <refbody>
        <section>
            <p>
                <table id="tableID-resolved_issues" frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1">
                    <title>Resolved issues</title>
                    <tgroup cols="3">
                        <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1"/>
                        <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2"/>
                        <colspec colnum="3" colname="col3"/>
                        <thead>
                            <row>
                                <entry>ID</entry>
                                <entry>Summary</entry>
                                <entry>Description</entry>
                            </row>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <row>
                                <entry>HDM</entry>
                                <entry>HDM throws an exception when the USP device sends any
                                    notifications prior to the OnBoard notification</entry>
                                <entry><b>Symptoms.</b> HDM encounters a NullPointerException (NPE)
                                    when it receives notifications from the USP devices before the
                                    OnBoard notification, Due to these exceptions, trace log file
                                    grows quickly.<p><b>Resolution.</b> This issue occurs due to the
                                        absence of the DeviceID triplet for the agent's endpointID.
                                        This issue has been fixed in this release.</p></entry>
                            </row>
                            <!-- Additional rows omitted for brevity -->
                        </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                </table>
            </p>
        </section>
    </refbody>
</reference>